262
00:26:37,832 --> 00:26:39,800
Kau pikir kau bisa
mematahkan rahangku?

263
00:26:39,867 --> 00:26:44,438
Masukkan tanganmu ke tenggorokanku
dan cabut lidahku?

264
00:26:44,506 --> 00:26:46,173
Benar-benar?

265
00:26:49,777 --> 00:26:52,046
Itu akan sangat mengesankan!

266
00:26:52,446 --> 00:26:54,081
Nyatanya,

267
