425
00:40:23,490 --> 00:40:25,393
Kami disergap.

426
00:40:27,929 --> 00:40:32,133
Rocket datang.
Menghantam kepalanya hingga terlepas.

427
00:40:32,199 --> 00:40:33,701
Darah mengalir di sisi tubuh.

428
00:40:33,768 --> 00:40:37,038
